    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d213">

                <pb facs="0278" n="270" sameAs="frus:frus1941v07/pg270"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">822.796/291: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Ecuador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Long</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Quito</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-01-07T15:00:00-05:00">January 7, 1941—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10:22 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>5. Reference my despatch No. 1488, December 27.<anchor n="36" xml:id="d213-f1"/>
                    This morning’s press published Sedta<anchor n="37" xml:id="d213-f2"/> advisement
                    offering to carry all mail by air at ordinary postage rates.</p>
                <p>It has been ascertained that a contract was signed this morning valid for 5 years
                    under which Sedta agrees to carry up to 250 kilos of mail per trip at 10 sucres
                    a kilo. I am informed that the contract can be canceled by the Government upon 8
                    days notice and it is understood that the Government will receive any proposals
                        Panagra<anchor n="38" xml:id="d213-f3"/> may have to make.</p>
                <p>As Vidal<anchor n="39" xml:id="d213-f4"/> is not here I suggest that the
                    Department consult Panagra’s New York office regarding what countermove it is
                    prepared to make. No hint of prospective signature of contract was received.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Long</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d213-f1" n="36" xml:id="d213-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d213-f2" n="37" xml:id="d213-f2-content">
                <p>Sociedad Ecuatoriana de Transportes Aéreos, German-controlled commercial air
                    carrier.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d213-f3" n="38" xml:id="d213-f3-content">
                <p>Pan American-Grace Airways.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d213-f4" n="39" xml:id="d213-f4-content">
                <p>Gustavo Vidal, vice president of Panagra.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
